    "notes": "Melody and changes only; no lyrics. The traditional spiritual is encoded, not any later arranged or recorded treatment. Usually written in cut time; encoded here as 4/4 at the sung pulse. The 'Gon-na' and 'I ain't' anacrusis is carried at the END of the preceding section, since v1 has no negative beat; the first section played therefore enters on the downbeat."
